  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6655930",
      "title": "Outputting Lists with ngFor",
      "lectureOrder": 363,
      "videoOrder": 337,
      "sourceHash": "d4a9ee7474eae059d6a33b8efc82d92a24ac924dfd84573fde15b1eb73f354b6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.94,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "-: With all these directives learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "let's now have a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 9.63,
          "en": "at the last built in directive for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "An important one though, it's said that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 15.02,
          "en": "we can click the add server button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.02,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "but we don't actually add servers to our list here, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 21.06,
          "en": "This list doesn't grow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.06,
          "end": 23.186,
          "en": "This list is totally static.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.186,
          "end": 27.302,
          "en": "We can change this with the ngFor directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.302,
          "end": 29.32,
          "en": "So let's have a look at how it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.32,
          "end": 31.494,
          "en": "In our servers component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.494,
          "end": 36.494,
          "en": "we right now manually add our app-server component twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.158,
          "end": 41.13,
          "en": "It would be nicer to have an array of servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.13,
          "end": 43.35,
          "en": "which adds it dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 45.39,
          "en": "So in the servers component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.39,
          "end": 48.914,
          "en": "I'll add a new property servers, and this is an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.914,
          "end": 53.914,
          "en": "And here I could have my Testserver",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.263,
          "end": 59.263,
          "en": "and my Testserver 2 maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 62.839,
          "en": "And when we trade a new server here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.839,
          "end": 66.09,
          "en": "I actually want to access this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.09,
          "end": 70.68,
          "en": "of servers and push a new server on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 74.245,
          "en": "And this should of course, use the server name I setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.245,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "Now with this I have an array of servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 81.459,
          "en": "It would now be great if we could replicate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.459,
          "end": 84.608,
          "en": "the app-server component as often",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.608,
          "end": 88.38,
          "en": "as needed to have a server for each element in the array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.38,
          "end": 92.42099999999999,
          "en": "So two initially, and then a new one for each server we add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.42099999999999,
          "end": 93.60300000000001,
          "en": "We can do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.60300000000001,
          "end": 96.458,
          "en": "I'll get rid of the second app-server here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.458,
          "end": 98.31,
          "en": "and on the first one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.31,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "I will place another directive with a star",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "because this is now also a structural directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 105.00399999999999,
          "en": "changing the dom itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.00399999999999,
          "end": 108.27000000000001,
          "en": "It's the ngFor directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.27000000000001,
          "end": 112.138,
          "en": "The ngFor base syntax looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.138,
          "end": 114.805,
          "en": "We define a temporary variable for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.805,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "inside a loop with let give it any name you like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.56,
          "end": 123.56,
          "en": "like server, for example, and then of servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "Servers here is the property we defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "in the TypeScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 133.14,
          "en": "and this will now loop through all the elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.14,
          "end": 136.07999999999998,
          "en": "in this array and assign the individual element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.07999999999998,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "to this dynamic server variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "So that's just like, you might know this loop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 144.448,
          "en": "from a normal well JavaScript code, the for of loop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.448,
          "end": 148.50900000000001,
          "en": "this server variable can now be used in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.50900000000001,
          "end": 151.949,
          "en": "but here we don't really need it to be honest.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.949,
          "end": 156.309,
          "en": "We will soon learn in the next core section how",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.309,
          "end": 161.28,
          "en": "we can pass data to our own components to output it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.28,
          "end": 163.65,
          "en": "So for now, we won't need that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.65,
          "end": 166.322,
          "en": "But one thing we should see is that if I save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.322,
          "end": 169.5,
          "en": "and we go back to our application, we still see two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.5,
          "end": 171.18,
          "en": "because we start with two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.18,
          "end": 176.18,
          "en": "But if I add more servers, you see our list grows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 178.47,
          "en": "and we can click this as often as we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.47,
          "end": 180.66,
          "en": "Of course, the content of the individual",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 183.318,
          "en": "server is still static",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.318,
          "end": 185.796,
          "en": "because we can't pass the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.796,
          "end": 188.916,
          "en": "like the server name to that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.916,
          "end": 191.49,
          "en": "But that is something we will learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.49,
          "end": 194.25,
          "en": "in the next course section when we dive deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.25,
          "end": 196.5,
          "en": "into components and we will learn how",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.5,
          "end": 199.68,
          "en": "we can create our own properties on components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.68,
          "end": 202.023,
          "en": "We can then set from outside a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.023,
          "end": 204.387,
          "en": "which would be great to have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.387,
          "end": 207.54,
          "en": "So let's dive into this in the next course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.54,
          "end": 211.5,
          "en": "Before doing so though, let's practice the things we learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.5,
          "end": 213.927,
          "en": "in the last lectures, and then let's also set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.927,
          "end": 217.535,
          "en": "up our course project before we then dive deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.535,
          "end": 220.07999999999998,
          "en": "into components and data binding again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.07999999999998,
          "end": 221.553,
          "en": "So see you there.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
